{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06085","headline":"春过贺遂员外药园 · 王维","name":"春过贺遂员外药园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年槿篱故，新作药栏成。\n香草爲君子，名花是长卿。\n水穿盘石透，藤系古松生。\n画畏开厨走，来蒙到屣迎。\n蔗浆菰米饭，蒟酱露葵羹。\n颇识灌园意，於陵不自轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}